{"id":1481,"title":"Lambda函数有什么作用？","summary":"Lambda函数有什么作用？","tags":"","components":[{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"fcf8b69a-09c5-3bd3-aa47-04229d02b826","knowledge_id":163,"title":"Lambda函数有什么作用？","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":0,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":163,"title":"Lambda函数有什么作用？","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"512af0f9-d6e4-3052-91df-8337a6ce77d0","title":"","title_html":"","text":"在 Python 中，**lambda**函数没有名字，且只能包含一个表达式。可以使用 `lambda` 关键字来定义 **lambda** 函数。\n\n**例如：**","text_html":"<p>在 Python 中，<strong>lambda</strong>函数没有名字，且只能包含一个表达式。可以使用 <code>lambda</code> 关键字来定义 <strong>lambda</strong> 函数。</p>\n<p><strong>例如：</strong></p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"1e835fc5-f395-3ab8-bac7-95863387e0f7","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"# 普通的add函数 \ndef add(x, y):\n  return x + y\n\n# lambda 类型的add函数，二者等价\nadd = lambda x, y: x + y","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":false,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"6554a68b-ee05-3cc7-961e-221c9cc97272","title":"","title_html":"","text":"示例中，`:`前的 `x, y` 是参数，`:` 后的 `x + y` 是返回值。可以使用以下命令调用上述 **lambda** 函数：","text_html":"<p>示例中，<code>:</code>前的 <code>x, y</code> 是参数，<code>:</code> 后的 <code>x + y</code> 是返回值。可以使用以下命令调用上述 <strong>lambda</strong> 函数：</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"15d3196d-9a36-3a33-b010-495a51841f56","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","e